# ── SmartCommerce Frontend environment ───────────────────────────────────────
# Base URL of the SmartCommerce API.
#
# Leave UNSET for a frontend-only client preview: the storefront automatically
# falls back to the built-in demo tyre products, so the design is fully
# reviewable without a backend. (Auth, cart and checkout need a live API.)
#
# When the ASP.NET Core API is deployed, point this at it, e.g.:
# VITE_API_URL=https://vulkanizer-api.onrender.com/api/v1
#
# VITE_API_URL=
